# Reconstructed GFX906 full-BAR/P2P amdgpu patch evidence.
#
# Provenance:
# - Reconstructed from the 2026-06-19 dry-run target list and local ROCm 7.2
#   amdgpu source snapshots.
# - Original standalone patch file has not been recovered.
# - The amdgpu.h hunk is reconstructed from the dry-run target list and the
#   pcie_p2p symbol use visible in recovered source state.
# - Validate against a clean, exact source checkout before using this as a
#   build input.
#
# Source lock update:
# - The recovered .c files match ROCm/ROCK-Kernel-Driver tag rocm-7.2.1,
#   peeled commit d2762fd86fce89f0b32614aeca806a548c7f6993.
# - The official rocm-7.2.1 amdgpu.h contains the pcie_p2p declaration.
# - Do not apply this patch to rocm-7.2.1 without first checking whether the
#   relevant hunks are already present.
#
# This file is not an installation instruction and is not an official AMD patch.

